#5200
The Grand Gate Of Thalos~
   You stand beneath the great arch of Thalos, the first city of the east
and the first to fall. Its two steel gates were forced inward long ago and
have rusted where they hang, bent like paper. The names of the founding
houses are cut into the keystone, chipped almost smooth. A cold wind blows
past you into the dead city to the west; north, a track climbs back to the
Supply Road.
~
