~
~
0 -1 5014
E
gates gate steel~
The gates were not battered down. They were bent inward from the middle, as
if something had leaned on them until they gave.
~
E
keystone names arch~
The names of the houses of Thalos run around the keystone. Somebody has
scratched a small mark beside each one, the way the priests of Midgaard mark
the rolls of the dead.
~
