#5201
Main Street~
   The great street of Thalos runs west from the gate between the shells of
tall houses. Weeds grow in the cracks of its paving, and the wind has heaped
grey dust in every doorway. South stands a squat guard house, and north a
dark alley slips between two fallen walls; the gate is back east. Somewhere
deeper in the city something howls, and something else answers it.
~
