#5250
The Temple Of Thalos~
   You stand beneath the great dome of the temple of Thalos, once the
holiest place in the east. Long benches lie toppled and the altar has been
defiled. Stone has fallen from the roof, and thin shafts of daylight cut
down through the dust. Old books lie open on the floor. Four archways lead
out to the garden path: north, east, south and west. Under the dome,
something watches.
